    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32704" root="غيث" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَيْثٌ مُغِيثٌ</span></b>  <i>A general rain.</i> (TA.) [But the
epithet <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُغِيثٌ</span> evidently belongs to art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غوث</span>; and
the phrase properly signifies <i>A rain that gives
aid,</i> or <i>succour.</i>]

